Package: terroir
Title: Geo-Point Environmental and Agricultural-Economics Data Collector
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R:
    person("Max", "Moldovan", , "max.moldovan@adelaide.edu.au",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-9680-8474"))
Description: A uniform, point-keyed interface for retrieving climate, weather,
    vegetation-index, soil, elevation and agricultural-economics data for a
    geographic coordinate from many free data sources. Each source is wrapped as
    an optional adapter behind one request and response contract with mandatory
    provenance; the package builds and checks with no source package installed.
    The data-collector member of the ORCHESTRA.
